        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠡᠳᠦᠷ ᠤᠨᠠᠪᠠᠰᠤ ᠺᠦᠮᠦᠨ ᠢᠨᠤ ᠲᠠᠨᠢᠬᠳᠠᠮᠤᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>edyr unabasu kymyn inu --mui</transcript>
          <definition> A man becomes known in the course of time.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠲᠡᠷᠡ ᠨᠠᠳᠤᠷ ᠲᠠᠨᠢᠬᠳᠠᠭᠰᠠᠨ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>tere nadur --γsan ygei</transcript>
          <definition> I did not recognize him (lit.: he was not recognized by me).</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠠᠮ ᠰᠠᠶᠢᠬᠠᠨ ᠲᠠᠨᠢᠬᠳᠠᠵᠤ ᠪᠠᠶᠢᠮᠤᠢ</unicode>
